WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

4
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

5
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

6
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

7
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

8
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

9
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

10
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

11
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

12
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

13
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

14
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

15
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

16
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

17
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

18
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

19
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

20
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

21
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

22
01:53.179 --> 01:55.784
=Episode 18=

23
02:10.010 --> 02:10.609
Hello,

24
02:11.130 --> 02:11.850
Harry's mom.

25
02:24.609 --> 02:25.250
Satisfied now?

26
02:25.929 --> 02:26.449
Are you?

27
02:29.690 --> 02:30.250
Excuse me,

28
02:30.929 --> 02:31.889
another coffee, please.

29
02:40.769 --> 02:41.250
Tell me.

30
02:42.889 --> 02:43.850
Why call me here?

31
02:45.489 --> 02:46.649
It's simple.

32
02:47.609 --> 02:48.329
Work with me.

33
02:50.690 --> 02:51.130
Come on,

34
02:51.130 --> 02:52.049
aren't you being

35
02:52.049 --> 02:52.810
ridiculous?

36
02:53.290 --> 02:53.929
Take your son

37
02:53.929 --> 02:54.970
away from here.

38
02:56.209 --> 02:57.329
What if that's the offer?

39
02:57.970 --> 02:58.609
I'm listening.

40
02:59.250 --> 02:59.970
I know Han Guang

41
02:59.970 --> 03:01.729
will transfer the money to you.

42
03:01.729 --> 03:02.889
All I need to know now

43
03:03.240 --> 03:04.410
is the overseas account

44
03:04.410 --> 03:05.209
he's using

45
03:05.209 --> 03:06.489
to funnel company assets.

46
03:07.169 --> 03:08.130
What overseas account?

47
03:09.010 --> 03:09.649
I don't know.

48
03:12.570 --> 03:13.649
Does Harry know?

49
03:14.530 --> 03:15.690
Or rather,

50
03:16.729 --> 03:17.810
do you want him to know?

51
03:19.690 --> 03:20.290
What about you?

52
03:21.010 --> 03:21.690
What did you

53
03:21.690 --> 03:22.370
tell Haoyu?

54
03:24.889 --> 03:25.570
That meal

55
03:25.570 --> 03:26.970
only let Harry know

56
03:27.329 --> 03:28.410
that his mother

57
03:28.929 --> 03:30.010
was a maid in our house.

58
03:30.810 --> 03:31.769
After another meal,

59
03:32.609 --> 03:33.329
I can't guarantee

60
03:33.329 --> 03:34.209
what else he'll know.

61
03:34.810 --> 03:35.690
Betraying Han Guang

62
03:37.010 --> 03:37.889
would just expose me,

63
03:37.889 --> 03:38.530
wouldn't it?

64
03:40.570 --> 03:41.769
My only target is Han Guang.

65
03:42.370 --> 03:43.290
And taking him down

66
03:43.609 --> 03:44.449
benefits you too.

67
03:45.929 --> 03:47.090
Once he falls,

68
03:48.169 --> 03:49.489
the only one Di Liren can rely on

69
03:50.290 --> 03:51.290
will be you.

70
03:52.410 --> 03:53.570
When that happens,

71
03:54.049 --> 03:55.329
taking them abroad

72
03:55.609 --> 03:56.290
will be a breeze.

73
03:59.329 --> 04:00.370
No need to answer now.

74
04:01.049 --> 04:01.970
Take time to think,

75
04:03.769 --> 04:05.370
but don't keep me waiting too long.

76
04:06.489 --> 04:07.370
Chances don't wait.

77
04:13.649 --> 04:14.169
A word?

78
04:24.449 --> 04:25.529
What are you doing here?

79
04:26.170 --> 04:27.329
I have a meeting now.

80
04:28.010 --> 04:29.130
I'll see you tonight, okay?

81
04:29.409 --> 04:30.010
You say that

82
04:30.449 --> 04:31.250
to Meng and my mom

83
04:31.250 --> 04:32.010
a lot, don't you?

84
04:32.010 --> 04:32.930
What are you saying?

85
04:32.930 --> 04:33.649
Isn't it true?

86
04:33.930 --> 04:34.849
I'll just quote you.

87
04:35.329 --> 04:35.849
You said,

88
04:36.104 --> 04:37.050
"Methods don't matter,

89
04:37.050 --> 04:38.050
achieving the goal does."

90
04:38.050 --> 04:39.050
Playing both sides.

91
04:40.570 --> 04:41.810
Such profound wisdom.

92
04:43.170 --> 04:44.529
Stay out of this.

93
04:45.289 --> 04:45.969
I'll handle it.

94
04:46.649 --> 04:47.209
Handle who?

95
04:47.649 --> 04:48.089
My mom

96
04:48.409 --> 04:48.969
or Meng?

97
04:50.529 --> 04:50.889
Dad,

98
04:51.250 --> 04:52.810
you can only choose one of them.

99
04:53.529 --> 04:54.370
If you choose Meng,

100
04:54.690 --> 04:55.969
I'll live with Mom.

101
04:56.130 --> 04:57.209
Stop dragging her down.

102
04:58.130 --> 04:58.849
If you choose Mom,

103
04:59.730 --> 05:00.490
then divorce Meng.

104
05:01.370 --> 05:02.376
Stop wasting her time.

105
05:02.769 --> 05:03.170
Fine.

106
05:03.570 --> 05:04.130
I get it.

107
05:05.570 --> 05:06.769
Tell me right now.

108
05:07.089 --> 05:07.649
If you don't,

109
05:07.690 --> 05:08.744
I won't let you go.

110
05:08.849 --> 05:09.289
And I'll

111
05:09.449 --> 05:10.889
call you "Dad" at Jiali every day.

112
05:13.370 --> 05:14.289
Do you think the choice

113
05:14.329 --> 05:15.170
is mine?

114
05:15.730 --> 05:17.209
I'm the one being chosen.

115
05:17.730 --> 05:18.170
Besides,

116
05:19.250 --> 05:20.370
it's not a choice.

117
05:21.329 --> 05:22.130
Not that simple.

118
05:23.769 --> 05:24.449
Then why

119
05:24.449 --> 05:25.690
did you make such a mistake?

120
05:25.969 --> 05:27.370
Why did you hurt Mom,

121
05:27.570 --> 05:28.930
and still fail to cherish Meng?

122
05:29.889 --> 05:31.289
I understand you defending

123
05:32.010 --> 05:32.610
your mom,

124
05:34.329 --> 05:35.849
but why are you

125
05:36.649 --> 05:37.610
looking out for Yu Meng?

126
05:38.010 --> 05:39.050
Meng is my friend.

127
05:39.329 --> 05:40.250
She deserves better.

128
05:41.170 --> 05:42.010
If not for you,

129
05:43.089 --> 05:44.329
she could find someone better.

130
05:45.050 --> 05:46.050
She could have met

131
05:46.250 --> 05:47.730
someone faithful and committed.

132
05:51.250 --> 05:53.370
Feelings are complicated.

133
05:54.010 --> 05:55.250
At your age,

134
05:55.690 --> 05:56.776
you wouldn't understand.

135
05:57.329 --> 05:57.810
So,

136
05:58.889 --> 06:00.329
I completely understand

137
06:00.370 --> 06:01.250
and accept

138
06:01.449 --> 06:02.370
your emotions now.

139
06:03.649 --> 06:04.610
But this is between me,

140
06:04.610 --> 06:05.130
your mom,

141
06:05.130 --> 06:06.170
and Yu Meng.

142
06:06.690 --> 06:07.769
We'll handle it ourselves.

143
06:08.370 --> 06:09.050
I promise

144
06:09.810 --> 06:11.130
there will be an end to this.

145
06:12.649 --> 06:13.170
But now,

146
06:13.170 --> 06:14.170
I really gotta go.

147
06:43.490 --> 06:44.810
(Take your son away from here.)

148
06:45.329 --> 06:46.490
What if that's the offer?

149
06:56.449 --> 06:57.529
(Does Harry know?)

150
06:58.170 --> 06:59.010
Or rather,

151
07:00.130 --> 07:01.449
do you want him to know?

152
07:02.209 --> 07:03.449
(Once he falls,)

153
07:03.464 --> 07:04.889
(the only one Di Liren can rely on)

154
07:04.889 --> 07:05.649
(will be you.)

155
07:06.280 --> 07:07.130
(When that happens,)

156
07:07.130 --> 07:08.089
(taking them abroad)

157
07:08.649 --> 07:09.409
(will be a breeze.)

158
07:16.930 --> 07:17.370
Hello?

159
07:17.730 --> 07:19.050
How does Haoyu seem?

160
07:19.409 --> 07:19.889
Is he okay?

161
07:20.730 --> 07:21.250
He's fine.

162
07:22.490 --> 07:23.409
After what you said,

163
07:24.209 --> 07:25.289
what could he brood about?

164
07:25.730 --> 07:27.289
Okay, get some rest.

165
07:27.889 --> 07:28.769
Don't hang up yet.

166
07:29.130 --> 07:29.640
What's up?

167
07:30.209 --> 07:31.250
If Han Guang goes down,

168
07:32.529 --> 07:33.289
what will you do?

169
07:33.969 --> 07:34.969
I'll take you and Haoyu

170
07:35.050 --> 07:35.930
abroad right away,

171
07:36.089 --> 07:36.810
totally unscathed.

172
07:39.050 --> 07:40.130
Why ask all of a sudden?

173
07:40.449 --> 07:41.320
Is everything okay?

174
07:41.730 --> 07:42.250
It's nothing.

175
07:43.010 --> 07:44.050
I'm tired. Going to sleep.

176
08:38.450 --> 08:39.289
(Yu Meng) 10:00 AM.

177
08:39.730 --> 08:40.850
I'll give you what you want.

178
08:48.027 --> 08:51.208
(Ideal Experimental School)

179
08:53.610 --> 08:54.450
Come on, Chestnut.

180
08:54.649 --> 08:55.649
Have a good day.

181
08:55.730 --> 08:57.010
Just like Mom,

182
08:57.330 --> 08:59.130
I'm only happy on vacation.

183
09:00.090 --> 09:01.210
Look at you.

184
09:02.289 --> 09:03.090
Go on.

185
09:03.689 --> 09:04.250
Chestnut,

186
09:05.010 --> 09:05.730
a little sugar

187
09:05.850 --> 09:06.696
fixes everything.

188
09:08.610 --> 09:09.689
Uncle Kang made

189
09:09.689 --> 09:10.809
my day again.

190
09:12.370 --> 09:13.409
I'll put it away. Careful.

191
09:15.610 --> 09:16.090
All right.

192
09:16.250 --> 09:16.730
Take it.

193
09:17.250 --> 09:17.970
Bye, Kang.

194
09:18.169 --> 09:18.929
Bye, Mom.

195
09:19.049 --> 09:20.090
Okay. Bye-bye. Be careful.

196
09:20.610 --> 09:21.210
Okay.

197
09:21.450 --> 09:22.049
Don't run!

198
09:22.450 --> 09:23.130
Didn't you say

199
09:23.130 --> 09:24.689
you wouldn't waste a single second?

200
09:24.689 --> 09:25.250
You've already

201
09:25.250 --> 09:26.250
wasted a minute.

202
09:26.730 --> 09:28.210
Can't I come see Chestnut?

203
09:28.450 --> 09:29.169
Sorry,

204
09:29.370 --> 09:30.569
I don't want you so involved

205
09:30.610 --> 09:31.490
in my daughter's life.

206
09:31.889 --> 09:32.330
Goodbye.

207
09:33.610 --> 09:34.090
Liu Zi.

208
09:37.289 --> 09:37.730
Wait, Mom.

209
09:37.730 --> 09:38.409
How could you

210
09:38.409 --> 09:39.496
dress my boy in this?

211
09:40.169 --> 09:41.049
Change it.

212
09:41.769 --> 09:42.210
Yeah.

213
09:42.970 --> 09:43.889
The one behind is fine.

214
09:43.929 --> 09:44.610
That color works.

215
09:44.929 --> 09:45.529
Yeah, okay.

216
09:47.250 --> 09:48.090
Right, that's better.

217
09:48.529 --> 09:49.250
Okay.

218
09:57.450 --> 09:58.130
Why are you here?

219
10:02.370 --> 10:03.330
Where are you going?

220
10:03.649 --> 10:04.584
Give it to me.

221
10:05.250 --> 10:06.088
Give it back!

222
10:10.139 --> 10:11.048
(Nassau Island Asset Management Co., Ltd.)

223
10:15.610 --> 10:16.809
No wonder you mentioned

224
10:16.850 --> 10:18.049
Han Guang suddenly last night.

225
10:18.689 --> 10:19.610
Who are you

226
10:19.730 --> 10:20.610
giving this to?

227
10:21.370 --> 10:21.850
Yu Meng?

228
10:22.370 --> 10:23.090
Giving it to her

229
10:23.090 --> 10:24.169
can end all this sooner,

230
10:24.529 --> 10:25.130
and Haoyu won't

231
10:25.130 --> 10:26.049
know the truth.

232
10:26.824 --> 10:27.529
Isn't it nice?

233
10:38.090 --> 10:39.169
I'll pretend this

234
10:39.169 --> 10:39.970
never happened.

235
10:40.090 --> 10:41.250
You had a lapse in judgment,

236
10:42.289 --> 10:43.090
but I don't want

237
10:43.130 --> 10:44.330
to see it happen again.

238
10:44.370 --> 10:44.929
Why?

239
10:46.049 --> 10:46.889
For Haoyu,

240
10:47.450 --> 10:48.490
I'd risk anything.

241
10:48.529 --> 10:49.649
You're too naive.

242
10:51.049 --> 10:52.090
Yu Meng's sweet talk

243
10:52.090 --> 10:53.250
had you spinning.

244
10:53.610 --> 10:55.130
Even if she can take down Han Guang,

245
10:55.769 --> 10:56.970
do you think she'll spare you?

246
10:57.169 --> 10:58.330
If she loses to him,

247
10:58.409 --> 10:59.130
and he finds out

248
10:59.130 --> 10:59.970
you backstabbed him,

249
11:00.049 --> 11:01.130
with his power,

250
11:01.250 --> 11:02.730
he'll make you suffer a lot.

251
11:02.889 --> 11:03.769
Suffer a lot?

252
11:04.169 --> 11:05.490
I've already been through it.

253
11:06.450 --> 11:07.850
Haven't I already been suffering?

254
11:10.330 --> 11:11.809
I don't want you jumping

255
11:11.850 --> 11:13.049
from one fire into another.

256
11:13.289 --> 11:14.130
When you do that,

257
11:14.169 --> 11:15.370
do you know how it hurts me?

258
11:15.649 --> 11:17.090
I was almost stabbed in the back

259
11:17.210 --> 11:18.490
by the person I love most.

260
11:19.169 --> 11:20.010
Believe it or not,

261
11:21.529 --> 11:22.850
I did this for your own good.

262
11:23.490 --> 11:25.169
You can't let go of power and greed,

263
11:25.330 --> 11:26.450
so I had to give you a push.

264
11:26.850 --> 11:27.809
If it's for my own good,

265
11:28.210 --> 11:29.809
stand firmly by my side,

266
11:30.330 --> 11:31.169
not Yu Meng's.

267
11:31.929 --> 11:33.330
We are the family here.

268
11:36.251 --> 11:37.288
(Yu Meng)

269
11:52.284 --> 11:52.929
(Lu Hui)

270
11:52.929 --> 11:54.049
We were one step away.

271
11:54.450 --> 11:55.330
Yesterday, she already

272
11:55.330 --> 11:56.049
agreed to meet me.

273
11:58.970 --> 12:00.090
Plans change all the time.

274
12:00.490 --> 12:01.250
Since Lu Hui

275
12:01.250 --> 12:02.490
is about to rat out Han Guang,

276
12:02.569 --> 12:03.970
it proves this path is viable.

277
12:04.450 --> 12:05.730
We'll just find another way.

278
12:08.850 --> 12:09.649
So annoying.

279
12:17.649 --> 12:18.370
Hello, Mom.

280
12:19.169 --> 12:19.649
Why

281
12:19.649 --> 12:20.529
video call me now?

282
12:21.130 --> 12:21.649
Meng,

283
12:22.090 --> 12:23.250
look!

284
12:23.809 --> 12:25.610
Isn't the view gorgeous?

285
12:26.250 --> 12:26.730
In a bit,

286
12:26.730 --> 12:27.970
when the sun sets,

287
12:28.210 --> 12:28.970
it's even prettier.

288
12:29.210 --> 12:29.610
Look.

289
12:30.130 --> 12:31.409
Let me show you.

290
12:32.049 --> 12:32.730
Take a look.

291
12:34.450 --> 12:35.569
The scenery is nice.

292
12:36.289 --> 12:36.929
Who is with you?

293
12:37.409 --> 12:37.769
Look.

294
12:38.010 --> 12:39.250
Long time no see.

295
12:39.450 --> 12:40.649
I'm keeping your mom company.

296
12:44.450 --> 12:45.210
Why are you there?

297
12:47.730 --> 12:48.409
Well,

298
12:49.250 --> 12:50.490
I come here often.

299
12:50.529 --> 12:51.610
I came here several times

300
12:51.889 --> 12:52.809
with my parents

301
12:52.809 --> 12:54.210
and yours.

302
12:54.529 --> 12:55.529
Now that

303
12:56.370 --> 12:57.809
she's staying here long-term,

304
12:58.130 --> 12:59.049
I'll visit her

305
12:59.970 --> 13:01.169
more often.

306
13:02.010 --> 13:03.409
I can visit my mom myself.

307
13:03.610 --> 13:04.490
Save your visit.

308
13:05.529 --> 13:06.649
Now, please give the phone

309
13:06.649 --> 13:07.689
right back to my mom.

310
13:08.169 --> 13:08.649
Thank you.

311
13:09.090 --> 13:09.610
All right.

312
13:09.889 --> 13:10.210
Here.

313
13:17.529 --> 13:18.730
(Di Liren) Yu Meng has a lawyer with her.

314
13:19.049 --> 13:19.889
Just scare her a bit.

315
13:20.210 --> 13:21.769
No real threats.

316
13:21.889 --> 13:22.889
Or they'll use it.

317
13:23.289 --> 13:24.529
(I know what I'm doing.)

318
13:24.610 --> 13:25.769
(Just teaching her a lesson)

319
13:25.929 --> 13:26.569
(to remind her)

320
13:26.610 --> 13:28.169
(to keep her hands off my accounts.)

321
13:34.409 --> 13:34.970
Hello?

322
13:35.368 --> 13:35.970
(Keep Quiet)

323
13:35.970 --> 13:36.769
I want to upgrade

324
13:36.769 --> 13:37.769
my mom's security level.

325
13:38.169 --> 13:39.210
Except for me, no one

326
13:39.210 --> 13:40.289
can approach her.

327
13:40.450 --> 13:41.250
At all times,

328
13:41.370 --> 13:42.769
ensure her personal safety.

329
14:50.010 --> 14:50.450
(Dad,)

330
14:50.689 --> 14:51.809
(you felt unwell lately.)

331
14:51.809 --> 14:52.425
(What's wrong?)

332
14:52.425 --> 14:53.490
(I have trouble sleeping.)

333
14:53.490 --> 14:54.210
(I can hear)

334
14:54.210 --> 14:55.450
(all this loud noise in my ears)

335
14:55.450 --> 14:56.730
(when I close my eyes.)

336
14:56.730 --> 14:57.210
(It's been)

337
14:57.210 --> 14:57.850
(over a month.)

338
14:57.850 --> 14:58.450
(He's)

339
14:58.450 --> 14:59.049
(getting worse.)

340
14:59.049 --> 15:00.289
(His sleep is getting poorer.)

341
15:00.289 --> 15:01.370
- (This time, the patient) - (Insisting on being discharged.)

342
15:01.450 --> 15:02.569
(had another stroke)

343
15:02.610 --> 15:03.752
(after a brain hemorrhage.)

344
15:05.010 --> 15:06.169
(Legally speaking,)

345
15:06.529 --> 15:07.569
(can he be deemed)

346
15:07.610 --> 15:08.929
(to lack civil capacity?)

347
15:09.130 --> 15:09.769
(Pretty much.)

348
15:10.689 --> 15:11.250
Meng,

349
15:12.370 --> 15:13.010
what's wrong?

350
