697
27:55.250 --> 27:56.049
- He's leaving through the back. - it's very simple.

698
27:56.410 --> 27:56.970
Okay.

699
27:57.289 --> 27:58.930
Life is a spiritual practice.

700
27:59.569 --> 28:02.010
Let us walk with the wise

701
28:02.210 --> 28:04.049
and journey with the kind.

702
28:04.490 --> 28:05.129
Thank you.

703
28:06.049 --> 28:06.650
Well said!

704
28:06.809 --> 28:08.329
Bravo!

705
28:17.930 --> 28:19.170
Master, that was inspiring!

706
28:20.049 --> 28:21.049
Your car is in the back.

707
28:21.089 --> 28:21.609
Follow me.

708
28:22.210 --> 28:23.089
Thanks, Jiao.

709
28:23.129 --> 28:23.730
No problem.

710
28:30.609 --> 28:31.490
Thank you, Master.

711
28:31.970 --> 28:32.890
On top of your fee,

712
28:32.930 --> 28:34.089
the host also prepared cases

713
28:34.129 --> 28:35.250
of fine wine and cigarettes.

714
28:37.329 --> 28:38.730
Once greed stirs,

715
28:38.769 --> 28:40.129
countless troubles follow.

716
28:40.930 --> 28:41.849
I appreciate it,

717
28:42.690 --> 28:44.289
but you should take them back.

718
28:44.930 --> 28:46.210
They're already in your car.

719
28:46.490 --> 28:47.690
Have mercy.

720
28:47.730 --> 28:49.129
Spare us having to haul them again.

721
28:50.329 --> 28:51.049
Fair enough.

722
28:52.329 --> 28:53.569
I shouldn't trouble you

723
28:53.609 --> 28:55.890
to haul them back and forth.

724
28:57.569 --> 28:58.450
Just this once.

725
29:04.769 --> 29:05.730
Sorry about that.

726
29:06.369 --> 29:07.809
I have to rush to my next event.

727
29:08.650 --> 29:09.609
My friend is rushing me.

728
29:10.849 --> 29:11.369
The organizer

729
29:11.369 --> 29:12.609
also prepared a banquet.

730
29:12.849 --> 29:14.129
It's all your favorites,

731
29:14.129 --> 29:15.690
pork chitterlings, roasted lamb,

732
29:15.730 --> 29:16.569
even pork brains.

733
29:29.930 --> 29:30.410
Mom,

734
29:31.304 --> 29:32.010
why call me back

735
29:32.010 --> 29:32.769
in such a hurry?

736
29:35.970 --> 29:37.329
Where are you going?

737
29:37.410 --> 29:38.289
I'm taking you abroad.

738
29:39.369 --> 29:40.250
Flight's tomorrow.

739
29:41.329 --> 29:41.970
Why?

740
29:42.369 --> 29:43.410
School hasn't started yet,

741
29:43.410 --> 29:43.930
and

742
29:44.329 --> 29:45.369
I don't want to go abroad.

743
29:46.210 --> 29:47.170
I'm done with the Yus.

744
29:47.529 --> 29:48.609
And I'm not getting dragged

745
29:48.730 --> 29:50.089
into your dad's new family.

746
29:51.049 --> 29:52.872
I'm going abroad with you for your study.

747
29:53.329 --> 29:53.769
I have

748
29:53.769 --> 29:54.569
packed your luggage.

749
29:54.690 --> 29:55.569
Check what's left.

750
29:55.890 --> 29:56.609
Pack it yourself.

751
30:00.049 --> 30:01.490
Does it have to be so rushed?

752
30:01.650 --> 30:02.210
Besides,

753
30:02.490 --> 30:03.490
why do you decide for me

754
30:03.490 --> 30:04.609
without even talking to me?

755
30:05.609 --> 30:06.450
I'm not going abroad.

756
30:06.930 --> 30:08.040
I don't want to go.

757
30:14.609 --> 30:15.609
That thing in your hand.

758
30:16.049 --> 30:17.448
How did you get it?

759
30:18.250 --> 30:19.450
Someone gave it to me.

760
30:19.450 --> 30:19.930
Who?

761
30:21.250 --> 30:21.730
Yu Meng?

762
30:23.930 --> 30:25.179
How did you know?

763
30:25.179 --> 30:26.152
(Yu Meng)

764
30:30.171 --> 30:31.688
(Yu Meng)

765
30:34.504 --> 30:35.656
(Yu Meng)

766
30:40.129 --> 30:41.289
I'm changing our flight now.

767
30:41.849 --> 30:42.809
We're leaving tonight.

768
30:43.369 --> 30:43.890
Wait.

769
30:44.410 --> 30:45.369
What exactly happened?

770
30:45.410 --> 30:46.529
Are we fugitives,

771
30:46.529 --> 30:47.289
or on the run?

772
30:47.289 --> 30:47.970
I can't explain

773
30:47.970 --> 30:48.769
in a few words.

774
30:49.690 --> 30:50.849
Pack your bags right now.

775
30:51.250 --> 30:52.089
We're heading out

776
30:52.289 --> 30:53.010
in half an hour.

777
30:53.490 --> 30:54.170
Tell me,

778
30:54.609 --> 30:55.569
or I won't move an inch.

779
30:55.849 --> 30:57.089
I'm your mom! Would I hurt you?

780
30:58.049 --> 30:59.089
Just trust me

781
30:59.529 --> 31:00.529
and do as I say.

782
31:01.049 --> 31:01.529
Be good.

783
31:01.849 --> 31:03.049
Be good?

784
31:03.170 --> 31:04.129
I should know what it is

785
31:04.129 --> 31:05.250
before I decide.

786
31:05.410 --> 31:05.809
Mom,

787
31:06.089 --> 31:06.890
I respect you.

788
31:06.890 --> 31:08.089
Please have some empathy

789
31:08.089 --> 31:08.930
and respect me too.

790
31:08.930 --> 31:10.250
The moment I was back,

791
31:10.410 --> 31:11.690
I've just been pushed around

792
31:11.769 --> 31:12.970
and ordered where to go.

793
31:13.410 --> 31:14.369
Can't I have a say

794
31:14.369 --> 31:15.089
and decide myself?

795
31:15.089 --> 31:16.450
What's the point of telling you?

796
31:17.129 --> 31:18.529
This is between adults!

797
31:18.970 --> 31:19.690
You're just a kid.

798
31:19.809 --> 31:21.250
You don't need to know,

799
31:21.650 --> 31:22.849
so stay out of it!

800
31:23.490 --> 31:24.329
Hurry up and pack!

801
31:24.690 --> 31:25.849
Right now!

802
31:31.410 --> 31:32.210
Unbelievable.

803
31:32.860 --> 31:33.640
(Passport)

804
31:41.170 --> 31:41.650
I'm done

805
31:41.650 --> 31:42.650
being treated like a kid.

806
31:42.970 --> 31:43.890
You hide everything

807
31:43.890 --> 31:44.730
from me,

808
31:45.170 --> 31:45.690
yet expect me

809
31:45.690 --> 31:46.609
to follow your orders.

810
31:47.089 --> 31:47.569
Why?

811
31:48.569 --> 31:49.544
I'm not going.

812
31:50.129 --> 31:51.528
What are you doing?

813
31:52.010 --> 31:52.890
I'm not going abroad,

814
31:52.970 --> 31:54.410
and I'm not coming back anymore!

815
31:57.490 --> 31:58.210
Stop right there!

816
31:59.450 --> 32:00.049
Haoyu!

817
32:01.210 --> 32:02.210
Fang Haoyu!

818
32:04.210 --> 32:04.970
Haoyu!

819
32:07.690 --> 32:08.690
Fang Haoyu!

820
32:35.289 --> 32:35.970
Harry?

821
32:40.289 --> 32:40.650
Here.

822
32:41.049 --> 32:41.849
Have some hot water.

823
32:42.250 --> 32:42.769
Thanks.

824
32:45.170 --> 32:46.289
Running away from home

825
32:46.410 --> 32:47.769
doesn't sound like you.

826
32:48.250 --> 32:48.890
What happened?

827
32:49.410 --> 32:50.609
We couldn't see eye to eye.

828
32:51.049 --> 32:52.264
Had a fight with my mom.

829
32:52.690 --> 32:53.250
Meng,

830
32:53.490 --> 32:54.809
I really have nowhere else to go.

831
32:55.170 --> 32:56.010
Could you take me in

832
32:56.010 --> 32:56.769
just for now?

833
32:58.210 --> 32:58.769
Well,

834
32:59.329 --> 33:00.650
I'll book a hotel for you.

835
33:00.650 --> 33:01.170
No.

836
33:01.529 --> 33:02.369
She will find me

837
33:02.369 --> 33:02.890
via all kinds

838
33:02.890 --> 33:03.410
of apps.

839
33:03.690 --> 33:05.170
I'll book under my membership.

840
33:05.369 --> 33:06.450
Your info won't be on it.

841
33:06.730 --> 33:07.490
Will this do?

842
33:11.809 --> 33:13.250
It's pouring outside.

843
33:13.450 --> 33:15.170
It's a bad idea to be out on the road.

844
33:15.170 --> 33:16.410
I'm just too exhausted to move.

845
33:17.129 --> 33:18.049
Meng, please!

846
33:18.329 --> 33:18.690
I...

847
33:19.089 --> 33:20.450
I can just sleep on the couch.

848
33:20.769 --> 33:21.289
I can even

849
33:21.410 --> 33:22.369
help out in the shop

850
33:23.089 --> 33:24.369
and chat with everyone.

851
33:26.730 --> 33:27.369
Please!

852
33:28.529 --> 33:29.329
You can't just

853
33:29.369 --> 33:30.250
hide here forever.

854
33:31.010 --> 33:32.010
Enough. Go take a shower.

855
33:32.529 --> 33:33.490
Thanks, Meng!

856
33:47.650 --> 33:48.369
Haoyu!

857
33:52.410 --> 33:53.369
Fang Haoyu!

858
34:04.170 --> 34:04.970
Stop calling.

859
34:08.129 --> 34:09.010
He won't answer.

860
34:23.649 --> 34:24.729
You got wet,

861
34:25.576 --> 34:27.129
but must you tear my umbrella

862
34:27.129 --> 34:27.850
apart?

863
34:27.850 --> 34:29.169
Is it an umbrella to shelter me,

864
34:30.290 --> 34:30.930
or just another

865
34:30.970 --> 34:31.930
trap-laden net?

866
34:35.450 --> 34:36.410
Want to interrogate me

867
34:36.450 --> 34:37.569
out here in the rain,

868
34:38.890 --> 34:39.649
or talk

869
34:40.330 --> 34:41.049
properly

870
34:41.049 --> 34:42.049
about where your son is?

871
34:58.890 --> 35:00.089
I checked all around.

872
35:00.649 --> 35:01.410
Haoyu isn't here.

873
35:02.810 --> 35:03.529
Don't worry.

874
35:03.689 --> 35:04.450
He's safe.

875
35:09.116 --> 35:10.890
(Yanshan Pavilion)

876
35:10.890 --> 35:11.609
You played me?

877
35:12.249 --> 35:13.729
You broke my umbrella

878
35:13.810 --> 35:14.770
and left me soaked,

879
35:15.689 --> 35:16.930
so shouldn't I shower

880
35:17.169 --> 35:18.330
and clean up before we talk?

881
35:25.169 --> 35:26.089
Can you talk now?

882
35:26.490 --> 35:28.129
The company is facing a cash crunch,

883
35:28.490 --> 35:29.649
blocked by Di Liren.

884
35:31.249 --> 35:32.729
Help me resolve that first,

885
35:33.370 --> 35:34.089
and I'll help you

886
35:34.129 --> 35:34.850
with Harry.

887
35:35.729 --> 35:36.850
It's about Ms. Xu, isn't it?

888
35:40.330 --> 35:41.689
Looks like you know it all.

889
35:42.370 --> 35:43.810
Ms. Xu and your mom run in the same

890
35:43.850 --> 35:44.970
rich lady circle.

891
35:45.850 --> 35:46.689
Why don't you just

892
35:46.689 --> 35:47.529
ask your mom?

893
35:49.930 --> 35:51.490
Could my mom help you find your son?

894
35:53.970 --> 35:55.049
Let's be realistic.

895
35:56.129 --> 35:57.450
You don't want Harry to know

896
35:57.970 --> 35:59.049
what you and Di Liren

897
35:59.049 --> 35:59.930
have been up to.

898
36:00.529 --> 36:01.290
I can help you.

899
36:01.729 --> 36:02.290
Tell me.

900
36:03.370 --> 36:04.249
Since you came to me,

901
36:05.089 --> 36:06.249
you must already have a plan.

902
36:06.490 --> 36:07.810
Ms. Xu and her husband

903
36:08.049 --> 36:09.169
divorced long ago.

904
36:09.569 --> 36:10.770
They just kept it quiet.

905
36:12.290 --> 36:13.290
And

906
36:13.609 --> 36:14.729
at a tennis court

907
36:14.770 --> 36:15.689
she frequents lately,

908
36:16.249 --> 36:17.089
from what I know,

909
36:17.569 --> 36:18.490
Ms. Xu paid her coach

910
36:19.010 --> 36:20.249
500 thousand yuan

911
36:20.249 --> 36:20.850
all at once.

912
36:21.450 --> 36:22.770
If your information is true,

913
36:22.850 --> 36:23.890
I can solve Ms. Xu's

914
36:24.010 --> 36:24.850
funding issue for you

915
36:24.850 --> 36:26.049
in one move.

916
36:26.569 --> 36:27.450
In one move?

917
36:28.609 --> 36:29.450
Why should I, though?

918
36:30.770 --> 36:31.689
Why should I help you,

919
36:31.890 --> 36:32.770
and why should I trust

920
36:32.810 --> 36:33.850
you'll keep your word?

921
36:38.450 --> 36:39.049
Di Liren

922
36:39.049 --> 36:40.089
hasn't told you yet, huh?

923
36:40.850 --> 36:42.010
I've asked for a divorce.

924
36:42.689 --> 36:43.890
Don't you want to know

925
36:44.010 --> 36:44.930
what he said?

926
36:45.370 --> 36:46.729
Haven't you always wished

927
36:47.290 --> 36:48.689
I'd divorce Di Liren?

928
36:49.169 --> 36:49.970
That was before.

929
36:50.209 --> 36:51.569
He said he won't agree.

930
36:51.569 --> 36:52.729
I just want you to know

931
36:52.970 --> 36:54.249
that all my energy now

932
36:54.649 --> 36:55.729
goes toward taking him on

933
36:55.770 --> 36:56.872
and getting a divorce.

934
36:56.872 --> 36:58.290
I have no time and no reason

935
36:58.290 --> 36:58.930
to deceive you.

936
36:59.410 --> 36:59.930
The divorce

937
36:59.930 --> 37:01.169
is between the two of you.

938
37:01.970 --> 37:03.656
I don't care. Nor do I want to know.

939
37:04.330 --> 37:04.970
From now on,

940
37:04.970 --> 37:06.049
anything about Di Liren

941
37:06.290 --> 37:07.609
has nothing to do with me.

942
37:18.410 --> 37:19.850
Even though Lu Hui turned me down,

943
37:20.049 --> 37:21.450
I bet she'll help me

944
37:22.049 --> 37:22.770
this time.

945
37:22.810 --> 37:23.410
That confident?

946
37:23.450 --> 37:24.569
Because I can see

947
37:24.649 --> 37:25.930
how much Harry means to her.

948
37:26.010 --> 37:27.729
You really changed your mind

949
37:27.970 --> 37:29.450
and dragged Harry into this?

950
37:29.729 --> 37:31.089
Not really.

951
37:31.290 --> 37:32.410
I just want to use Harry

952
37:32.450 --> 37:33.370
to remind Lu Hui

953
37:33.569 --> 37:34.930
who matters most to her

954
37:35.249 --> 37:36.850
and who her real family is,

955
37:37.290 --> 37:38.609
to make her see Di Liren clearly.

956
37:38.850 --> 37:39.490
Fine.

957
37:39.850 --> 37:41.450
After all, involving Harry

958
37:42.010 --> 37:42.770
brings him closer

959
37:42.770 --> 37:43.689
to you as well.

960
37:45.209 --> 37:45.529
What?

961
37:47.689 --> 37:48.249
Nothing.

962
37:49.290 --> 37:49.930
Sounds like

963
37:49.970 --> 37:51.370
Di Liren and Lu Hui

964
37:51.609 --> 37:52.290
are falling out.

965
37:52.609 --> 37:53.569
All he cares

966
37:53.569 --> 37:54.290
is profit.

967
37:55.330 --> 37:56.209
A fallout is nothing

968
37:56.209 --> 37:56.890
special.

969
37:59.209 --> 38:00.410
But for me,

970
38:00.569 --> 38:01.249
ever since

971
38:01.249 --> 38:02.569
I found that black box,

972
38:02.729 --> 38:03.810
shares,

973
38:04.010 --> 38:05.209
money, and profits

974
38:05.249 --> 38:06.609
don't matter as much anymore.

975
38:07.649 --> 38:08.529
I can't lose my dad

976
38:08.529 --> 38:09.209
over such things.

977
38:09.689 --> 38:10.729
Through this divorce,

978
38:10.890 --> 38:12.010
you've really matured a lot.

979
38:13.169 --> 38:14.010
A surprise for you.

980
38:14.810 --> 38:15.529
Look who's here.

981
38:18.129 --> 38:18.810
(Please Keep Quiet) Meng.

982
38:19.089 --> 38:19.649
(Press Button for Assistance) Mom?

983
38:20.890 --> 38:22.330
You're finally back!

984
38:24.010 --> 38:25.249
Look how worn out you are.

985
38:25.450 --> 38:26.850
Look how much weight you've lost.

986
38:27.970 --> 38:29.410
I won't leave ever again.

987
38:29.609 --> 38:31.010
I'll stay with you and your dad.

988
38:32.010 --> 38:33.529
You're not leaving again?

989
38:33.529 --> 38:34.290
What about

990
38:34.290 --> 38:35.330
Master Xiuyuan's classes?

991
38:37.569 --> 38:38.770
He's a fraud!

992
38:39.089 --> 38:40.649
He talks like a saint, a vegetarian.

993
38:41.010 --> 38:42.089
No smoking, no drinking,

994
38:42.249 --> 38:43.609
dressed poorly

995
38:43.649 --> 38:45.129
like some ascetic monk,

996
38:45.330 --> 38:46.330
but in private,

997
38:46.850 --> 38:48.890
he binges on meat, alcohol, and cigarettes!

998
38:51.410 --> 38:52.770
Wasn't that you

999
38:52.810 --> 38:53.930
beside that scammer

1000
38:55.049 --> 38:56.089
that day?

1001
38:57.049 --> 38:57.609
Hello, ma'am.

1002
38:59.290 --> 39:00.049
How did you do it?

1003
39:00.490 --> 39:02.129
A client introduced me to Xiuyuan.

1004
39:02.529 --> 39:04.049
He had a partnership with the inn

1005
39:04.049 --> 39:04.609
up there,

1006
39:04.609 --> 39:05.930
so I played along

1007
39:05.970 --> 39:07.490
and helped him organize that lecture.

1008
39:09.490 --> 39:10.729
Which helped your mom

1009
39:10.770 --> 39:11.810
see the truth about him.

1010
39:13.049 --> 39:13.450
So,

1011
39:13.770 --> 39:14.649
did you two

1012
39:14.930 --> 39:15.729
plan all of this

1013
39:15.729 --> 39:16.569
behind my back?

1014
39:16.970 --> 39:17.609
No, Mom!

1015
39:17.970 --> 39:18.609
Absolutely not!

1016
39:30.410 --> 39:31.089
Hello, Ms. Xu.

1017
39:31.529 --> 39:32.089
Who are you?

1018
39:32.930 --> 39:33.569
I'm Lu Hui,

1019
39:33.609 --> 39:34.729
Mr. Di's maid.

1020
39:35.049 --> 39:36.010
Earlier this spring,

1021
39:36.010 --> 39:37.010
at a dinner you attended,

1022
39:37.370 --> 39:38.689
I gave Mr. Di sobering medicine.

1023
39:39.290 --> 39:40.649
You even asked me back then

1024
39:40.890 --> 39:42.010
if it was made domestically.

1025
39:43.049 --> 39:43.810
I remember now.

1026
39:44.729 --> 39:45.330
Why are you

1027
39:45.330 --> 39:46.169
at my front door?

1028
39:47.490 --> 39:48.569
To bring you something.

1029
39:49.249 --> 39:50.490
Mr. Di never told me

1030
39:50.529 --> 39:51.689
he was sending someone over.

1031
39:52.169 --> 39:52.930
And I specifically

1032
39:52.930 --> 39:53.890
instructed security

1033
39:54.209 --> 39:54.810
that we're not

1034
39:54.850 --> 39:56.129
having guests lately.

1035
39:56.129 --> 39:56.930
How did you get in?

1036
39:57.569 --> 39:58.810
You were hiring cleaners.

1037
39:59.249 --> 39:59.970
I applied,

1038
40:00.450 --> 40:01.529
and walked in openly.

1039
40:06.890 --> 40:08.169
You said you brought something?

1040
40:09.169 --> 40:09.970
What is it?

1041
